Your unfortunately loyal followers have continued their rage.

00:24:50.764 --> 00:24:51.284
Believing.

00:24:51.788 --> 00:24:54.388
that they would terrorize this port into releasing it.

00:24:55.820 --> 00:24:58.960
Prove to them that their reprisals and warnings are underrated.

00:25:00.540 --> 00:25:02.540
